.TH "LAGO" "1" "Aug 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-quotes-clone-quote-version - Clone a quote version


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago quotes clone-quote-version  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint copies a quote version into a new \fBdraft\fR version of the same quote, so that the deal can be renegotiated.
Any version of the quote can be cloned, but a quote can only carry one active version: the draft the quote currently holds, if any, is voided with the \fBsuperseded\fR reason. Cloning is therefore rejected with a \fB422\fR once a version of the quote has been approved.
A concurrent write on the same quote is reported as a \fB422\fR rather than retried, so a duplicated call can fail while the first one is still in flight.
This is a premium feature.


